card.text:
Equipped creature has protection from Gods and gets +X/+0, where X is the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.
Whenever equipped creature deals 10 or more combat damage, you get an emblem with "You may cast instant and sorcery spells without paying their mana costs."
Equip {2}

Trample, ward {2}
Devonia enters with four +1/+1 counters on it.
Whenever you attack, put a +1/+1 counter on each attacking creature you control with power greater than its base power.

If a creature card would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.
As long as a card exiled with this Equipment has flying, equipped creature has flying. The same is true for first strike, double strike, deathtouch, haste, hexproof, indestructible, lifelink, menace, protection, reach, trample, and vigilance.
Equip {1}

Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has trample if it's legendary.
Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card. Create a colorless Saga enchantment token with "r{3} — You may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost."
Equip {1}

When Blade of Destined Death enters, each opponent chooses six permanents they control, then sacrifices the rest.
Whenever another permanent leaves the battlefield, put a hone counter on Blade of Destined Death. (Each hone counter on an Equipment grants +1/+0 to equipped creature.)
Equip {2}
